00:04:58.110 --> 00:05:00.150
So I will round to three
significant figures,

00:05:00.150 --> 00:05:04.036
which is 0.189 grams.

00:05:04.036 --> 00:05:06.334
So this is,

00:05:06.334 --> 00:05:08.320
let me do this in a new color,

00:05:08.320 --> 00:05:13.320
0.189 grams of potassium chloride,

00:05:14.580 --> 00:05:17.420
which is exactly what they are asking us.

00:05:17.420 --> 00:05:19.693
And we are done.

